<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14322] False warning about DataRegionConfiguration.maxWalArchiveSize property usage</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14322</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;On every non-persistent startup the following is printed:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;DataRegionConfiguration.maxWalArchiveSize instead DataRegionConfiguration.walHistorySize would be used for removing old archive wal files&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This does not make sense when persistence is totally off.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, syntax should be fixed, &quot;instead of&quot;, should be more clear what&apos;s going on.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
